@startuml seq-charge
participant Merchant
participant Flow
actor Customer
participant "PaymentRouter" as Router
participant "Merchant's account" as Dest

Merchant -> Flow : create a charge (console or API)
Flow --> Merchant : payment link or QR
Customer -> Flow : opens the link
Flow --> Customer : signed authorization of the charge
Customer -> Router : pays (GatoPago or MetaMask)
Router -> Dest : USDC, directly or through CCTP from another network
Flow -> Router : confirms the payment onchain
Flow -> Merchant : signed webhook
@enduml
